==Trivia==
===Origin===
* This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Crimson Invasion|Cinccino|86}} from the {{TCG|Crimson Invasion}} expansion.
* This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fates Collide|Cinccino|88}} from the {{TCG|Fates Collide}} expansion.
* '''Do the Wave''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Jungle|Wigglytuff|16}} from the {{TCG|Jungle}} expansion.
* This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

